{"id": "t074-004", "text": "dafydd - Daf - says he's planning a surprise trip to porto for the anniversary and laila has no idea. leaving the morning after", "spans": [{"id": "p1", "type": "PERSON", "text": "dafydd", "pronoun": "he"}, {"id": "p2", "type": "PERSON", "text": "Daf", "pronoun": "he", "same_as": "p1"}, {"id": "e1", "type": "EVENT", "text": "surprise trip to porto", "owner": "p3", "event_type": "travel", "followup": "ask_outcome"}, {"id": "e2", "type": "EVENT", "text": "anniversary", "owner": "p1", "event_type": "anniversary", "followup": "congratulate"}, {"id": "p3", "type": "PERSON", "text": "laila", "pronoun": "unknown"}, {"id": "d1", "type": "DATE", "text": "the morning after", "anchor": "e1"}]}
{"id": "t074-007", "text": "bumped into theo at the station. him and ayo have called the wedding off, they split up a couple wks ago and ayo has moved back to her mum's in leeds. he was trying to be upbeat but he clearly isnt sleeping, said the worst bit is cancelling the venue and telling everyone. his brother Jack is staying w/ him for now which is good. he mentioned he might go travelling in the new yr", "spans": [{"id": "p1", "type": "PERSON", "text": "theo", "pronoun": "he"}, {"id": "p2", "type": "PERSON", "text": "ayo", "pronoun": "she"}, {"id": "e1", "type": "EVENT", "text": "split up", "event_type": "loss", "followup": "check_in", "owner": "p1"}, {"id": "d1", "type": "DATE", "text": "a couple wks ago", "anchor": "e1"}, {"id": "p3", "type": "PERSON", "text": "ayo", "pronoun": "she"}, {"id": "e2", "type": "EVENT", "text": "moved back", "event_type": "move", "followup": "check_in", "owner": "p2"}, {"id": "r1", "type": "RELATION", "text": "mum", "owner": "p2"}, {"id": "f1", "type": "FACT", "text": "in leeds", "fact_type": "home", "owner": "p2"}, {"id": "f2", "type": "FACT", "text": "trying to be upbeat", "fact_type": "feeling", "owner": "p1"}, {"id": "f3", "type": "FACT", "text": "isnt sleeping", "fact_type": "health", "owner": "p1"}, {"id": "f4", "type": "FACT", "text": "brother", "fact_type": "relationship", "owner": "p4"}, {"id": "p4", "type": "PERSON", "text": "Jack", "pronoun": "unknown", "owner": "p1"}, {"id": "e3", "type": "EVENT", "text": "go travelling", "event_type": "travel", "followup": "ask_outcome", "owner": "p1"}, {"id": "d2", "type": "DATE", "text": "in the new yr", "anchor": "e3"}]}
{"id": "t074-010", "text": "zainab is allergic to nuts, like epipen allergic. note for the wedding cake chat", "spans": [{"id": "p1", "type": "PERSON", "text": "zainab", "pronoun": "unknown"}, {"id": "f1", "type": "FACT", "text": "allergic to nuts", "fact_type": "diet", "owner": "p1"}, {"id": "f2", "type": "FACT", "text": "epipen allergic", "fact_type": "diet", "owner": "p1"}, {"id": "e1", "type": "EVENT", "text": "wedding cake chat", "event_type": "other", "followup": "none", "owner": "p1"}]}
{"id": "t074-012", "text": "jorge and mila celebrating 25 yrs on 8/22, kids throwing them a surprise party the saturday after. mateo is passing round a card at work and collecting for a gift, they want to get them a weekend in the lakes. dont forget to sign the card and give mateo £20 b4 friday. mila doesnt drink so maybe something non alcoholic for the toast", "spans": [{"id": "p1", "type": "PERSON", "text": "jorge", "pronoun": "unknown"}, {"id": "p2", "type": "PERSON", "text": "mila", "pronoun": "unknown"}, {"id": "e1", "type": "EVENT", "text": "25 yrs", "event_type": "anniversary", "followup": "congratulate", "owner": "p1"}, {"id": "d1", "type": "DATE", "text": "8/22", "anchor": "e1"}, {"id": "r1", "type": "RELATION", "text": "kids", "owner": "p1"}, {"id": "e2", "type": "EVENT", "text": "surprise party", "event_type": "party", "followup": "ask_outcome", "owner": "p1"}, {"id": "d2", "type": "DATE", "text": "the saturday after", "anchor": "e2"}, {"id": "p3", "type": "PERSON", "text": "mateo", "pronoun": "unknown"}, {"id": "a1", "type": "ACTION", "text": "sign the card", "action_type": "other", "timing": "before", "owner": "p1", "anchor": "e1"}, {"id": "a2", "type": "ACTION", "text": "give mateo £20", "action_type": "gift", "timing": "before", "owner": "p3", "anchor": "e1"}, {"id": "p4", "type": "PERSON", "text": "mateo", "pronoun": "unknown"}, {"id": "d3", "type": "DATE", "text": "b4 friday", "anchor": "a2"}, {"id": "p5", "type": "PERSON", "text": "mila", "pronoun": "unknown"}, {"id": "f1", "type": "FACT", "text": "doesnt drink", "fact_type": "diet", "owner": "p2"}]}
