{"id": "t074-025", "text": "rory and tariq had to cancel their anniversary dinner, tariq's dad went into hospital that afternoon w/ chest pains. they think it was a minor heart attack, he's having a stent put in thurs. tariq has been at the hospital every day and is exhausted. rory says they'll redo the dinner once his dad is home. tariq's sister Noor is flying in from dubai on the 21st to help", "spans": [{"id": "p1", "type": "PERSON", "text": "rory", "pronoun": "unknown"}, {"id": "p2", "type": "PERSON", "text": "tariq", "pronoun": "he"}, {"id": "p3", "type": "PERSON", "text": "tariq", "pronoun": "he"}, {"id": "r1", "type": "RELATION", "text": "dad", "owner": "p2"}, {"id": "e1", "type": "EVENT", "text": "went into hospital", "event_type": "medical", "followup": "check_in", "owner": "r1"}, {"id": "d1", "type": "DATE", "text": "that afternoon", "anchor": "e1"}, {"id": "f1", "type": "FACT", "text": "minor heart attack", "fact_type": "health", "owner": "r1"}, {"id": "e2", "type": "EVENT", "text": "having a stent put in", "event_type": "medical", "followup": "check_in", "owner": "r1"}, {"id": "d2", "type": "DATE", "text": "thurs", "anchor": "e2"}, {"id": "p4", "type": "PERSON", "text": "tariq", "pronoun": "he"}, {"id": "d3", "type": "DATE", "text": "every day"}, {"id": "f2", "type": "FACT", "text": "exhausted", "fact_type": "feeling", "owner": "p2"}, {"id": "p5", "type": "PERSON", "text": "rory", "pronoun": "unknown"}, {"id": "e3", "type": "EVENT", "text": "dinner", "event_type": "party", "followup": "ask_outcome", "owner": "p1", "occ": 2}, {"id": "r2", "type": "RELATION", "text": "dad", "owner": "p2"}, {"id": "p6", "type": "PERSON", "text": "tariq", "pronoun": "he"}, {"id": "f3", "type": "FACT", "text": "sister", "fact_type": "relationship", "owner": "p7"}, {"id": "p7", "type": "PERSON", "text": "Noor", "pronoun": "unknown", "owner": "p2"}, {"id": "e4", "type": "EVENT", "text": "flying in from dubai", "event_type": "travel", "followup": "check_in", "owner": "p7"}, {"id