{"id": "t074-033", "text": "long call w/ salma tonight. she's really struggling w/ the wedding planning. ravi's family want 400 guests and she wants 80 max, and her mum is somehow siding w/ ravi's lot. she cried a bit. venue visit is next sat and the tasting is the week after, she said she cant even think about menus rn. ravi is being sweet but avoids the whole thing. i said id come to the tasting w/ her", "spans": [{"id": "p1", "type": "PERSON", "text": "salma", "pronoun": "she"}, {"id": "d1", "type": "DATE", "text": "tonight"}, {"id": "f1", "type": "FACT", "text": "struggling", "owner": "p1", "fact_type": "feeling"}, {"id": "e1", "type": "EVENT", "text": "wedding", "owner": "p1", "event_type": "wedding", "followup": "check_in"}, {"id": "p2", "type": "PERSON", "text": "ravi", "pronoun": "unknown"}, {"id": "r1", "type": "RELATION", "text": "family", "owner": "p2"}, {"id": "r2", "type": "RELATION", "text": "mum", "owner": "p1"}, {"id": "p3", "type": "PERSON", "text": "ravi", "pronoun": "unknown"}, {"id": "e2", "type": "EVENT", "text": "venue visit", "owner": "p1", "event_type": "other", "followup": "check_in"}, {"id": "d2", "type": "DATE", "text": "next sat", "anchor": "e2"}, {"id": "e3", "type": "EVENT", "text": "tasting", "owner": "p1", "event_type": "other", "followup": "none"}, {"id": "d3", "type": "DATE", "text": "the week after", "anchor": "e3"}, {"id": "p4", "type": "PERSON", "text": "ravi", "pronoun": "unknown"}]}
{"id": "t074-037", "text": "jin and henrik finally set the date, wedding is July 12th at his parents farm outside oslo. honeymoon in the dolomites straight after, they leave the next morning. jin is a bit worried about the altitude bc of her asthma, seeing her gp about it on 6/2. henrik wants a ceilidh at the reception lol. they asked if i could do a reading, need to say yes properly by end of the month", "spans": [{"id": "p1", "type": "PERSON", "text": "jin", "pronoun": "she"}, {"id": "p2", "type": "PERSON", "text": "henrik", "pronoun": "he"}, {"id": "e1", "type": "EVENT", "text": "wedding", "owner": "p1", "event_type": "wedding", "followup": "congratulate"}, {"id": "d1", "type": "DATE", "text": "July 12th", "anchor": "e1"}, {"id": "r1", "type": "RELATION", "text": "parents", "owner": "p2"}, {"id": "e2", "type": "EVENT", "text": "honeymoon in the dolomites", "owner": "p1", "event_type": "travel", "followup": "ask_outcome"}, {"id": "d2", "type": "DATE", "text": "straight after", "anchor": "e2"}, {"id": "d3", "type": "DATE", "text": "the next morning", "anchor": "e2"}, {"id": "p3", "type": "PERSON", "text": "jin", "pronoun": "she"}, {"id": "f1", "type": "FACT", "text": "a bit worried about the altitude", "owner": "p1", "fact_type": "feeling"}, {"id": "f2", "type": "FACT", "text": "asthma", "owner": "p1", "fact_type": "health"}, {"id": "e3", "type": "EVENT", "text": "seeing her gp", "owner": "p1", "event_type": "medical", "followup": "check_in"}, {"id": "d4", "type": "DATE", "text": "6/2", "anchor": "e3"}, {"id": "p4", "type": "PERSON", "text": "henrik", "pronoun": "he"}, {"id": "a1", "type": "ACTION", "text": "say yes properly", "owner": "p1", "anchor": "e1", "action_type": "other", "timing": "before"}, {"id": "d5", "type": "DATE", "text": "by end of the month", "anchor": "a1"}]}
{"id": "t074-038", "text": "note to self: stop buying lunch out, it was £140 last month. meal prep sun nights, chickpea curry or the chicken traybake. gym mon wed fri b4 work, swim on sat. cancel the second streaming sub. look at the cheaper phone contract when mine ends on 11/30. and actually book the eye test ive been putting off since spring", "spans": [{"id": "a1", "type": "ACTION", "text": "stop buying lunch out", "action_type": "other", "timing": "unspecified"}, {"id": "d1", "type": "DATE", "text": "last month"}, {"id": "a2", "type": "ACTION", "text": "meal prep", "action_type": "other", "timing": "unspecified"}, {"id": "d2", "type": "DATE", "text": "sun nights", "anchor": "a2"}, {"id": "a3", "type": "ACTION", "text": "gym", "action_type": "other", "timing": "unspecified"}, {"id": "d3", "type": "DATE", "text": "mon wed fri b4 work", "anchor": "a3"}, {"id": "a4", "type": "ACTION", "text": "swim", "action_type": "other", "timing": "unspecified"}, {"id": "d4", "type": "DATE", "text": "sat", "anchor": "a4"}, {"id": "a5", "type": "ACTION", "text": "cancel the second streaming sub", "action_type": "other", "timing": "unspecified"}, {"id": "a6", "type": "ACTION", "text": "look at the cheaper phone contract", "action_type": "other", "timing": "unspecified"}, {"id": "d5", "type": "DATE", "text": "when mine ends on 11/30", "anchor": "a6"}, {"id": "a7", "type": "ACTION", "text": "book the eye test", "action_type": "other", "timing": "unspecified"}, {"id": "d6", "type": "DATE", "text": "since spring"}]}
